{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48220","headline":"嘲崔生 · 刘行敏","name":"嘲崔生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崔生犯夜行，武候正严更。\n幞头拳下落，高髻掌中擎。\n杖迹胸前出，绳文腕後生。\n愁人不惜夜，随意晓参横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘行敏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}